  id: mira_the_pacifist
  displayName: Mira the Pacifist
  description: Optional Kin rescue. Found in a hidden grove protected by tamed creatures.
  section: Kin Survivors
  behaviors:
  - Refuses to fight. Helps player tame creatures.
  - Establishes the Naturalist path at the base.
  - Will not enter dangerous areas.
  - Asks the player not to kill creatures unnecessarily.
  abilities:
  - Unlocks Calming Pheromone + Naturalist's Mantle recipes.
  - Will tame creatures the player brings home.
  - Provides Friendship Tokens daily.
  dropOrTradeItems:
  - Cannot be killed.
  - 'Death: Spirit unlocks all Pacifist-path legendary items.'
